    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9fStory\ud83d\udc9f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Ryunosuke, a young landlord, and you've just leased your property out to a newlywed couple. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiho and Shota have been together since high school. While Shota keeps hitting walls at work, only bringing home a modest income, the couple support each other and do their best to enjoy their sweet newlywed life. However, you can feel your heart pounding and blood rushing the moment you set eyes on Chiho. You\u2019re struck by her voluptuous bust, perfectly curvy figure, and her innocent untainted smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the couple hesitates after hearing the rent amount, you casually make a bold proposal: \u201cHow about letting Chiho clean my room to make up for the rent difference?\u201d The couple agrees, and your daring arrangement begins to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite having been called the &quot;legendary seducer&quot;, the bond between Chiho and Shota holds firm. At a loss, you turn to Lilith, a mischievous succubus who has long been irritated by Chiho\u2019s naive purity and together, you strike a pact. With Lilith\u2019s magic, you\u2019ll attempt to awaken Chiho\u2019s suppressed desires over 90 days, guiding her on a journey where pleasure and temptation blur the line between loyalty and lust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, the 90-day countdown begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9fFeatures\ud83d\udc9f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a simple housekeeping visit soon becomes something far more intimate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take every chance to interact with Chiho! Start with playful teasing, and gradually using Lilith\u2019s succubus magic to stimulate her from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, her hidden desires begin to surface as you carefully guide her down a path of temptation and pleasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/b87662aeaadcb29e1cc39dbe7430709f.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/751d7de6b6f52dd66121f0e52dec9f13.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/751d7de6b6f52dd66121f0e52dec9f13.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/751d7de6b6f52dd66121f0e52dec9f13.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Chiho\u2019s desire peaks, you can take things even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As her Lust Mark value increases, you\u2019ll unlock new succubus abilities and seductive gameplay mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as Chiho gradually loses control! Her innocent facade begins to crack as she starts taking the initiative herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until eventually\u2026 things spiral far beyond what anyone could have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/f65d2084f02d4230bb403f2dadb7ad7f.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/f65d2084f02d4230bb403f2dadb7ad7f.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/f65d2084f02d4230bb403f2dadb7ad7f.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/cf0369e78370f43901cc623d4f730367.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/cf0369e78370f43901cc623d4f730367.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/cf0369e78370f43901cc623d4f730367.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/af037c55d33d199a1ad5abb5171b0065?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Chiho\u2019s descent continues, new locations will become available, including the night market, izakaya bar, and hot spring inn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As her transformation progresses, Chiho begins to send you increasingly provocative selfies\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/331609ad40007495076a6e18c0a7f582.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/331609ad40007495076a6e18c0a7f582.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/331609ad40007495076a6e18c0a7f582.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/81a2372c8b13e9763efef423eb44993c.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/81a2372c8b13e9763efef423eb44993c.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/81a2372c8b13e9763efef423eb44993c.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc9fGame Play\ud83d\udc9f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this simulation game, you have 90 days to guide the heroine down a path of corruption. Each day is divided into four time slots: morning, afternoon, evening, and midnight. During each time slot, you can choose different actions such as working part-time to earn money, interacting with Chiho, or purchasing items. The game also features a variety of mini-games that help boost intimacy and advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/26f3bb02ab602966d7ea328c800bfa60.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/41d65e8ccdb45ef1a16c1dca912c90f9.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/41d65e8ccdb45ef1a16c1dca912c90f9.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/41d65e8ccdb45ef1a16c1dca912c90f9.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work part-time, you can earn money to purchase powerful items that help advance the story. For example, the Spy Cam allows you to peek into the room of the newlywed couple next door, while the Ninja Scroll unlocks special gameplay features. As Chiho's corruption energy continues to accumulate, players can unlock more Devil Skills, leading to new interactions and story developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/e4537b7bf013da01b2924c8ca6693ccd.poster.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/e4537b7bf013da01b2924c8ca6693ccd.webm?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/e4537b7bf013da01b2924c8ca6693ccd.mp4?t=1753816806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/ea46187251736810dddabd4bc56146dd.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/ab55145d78c902436ea311b4cd1806f9.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=2773 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/e4d2e0fdaafc9c6e7145d9d3669bb133.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412290/extras/9fe68e3a5bf37e8a44df45be2e2033ff.avif?t=1753816806\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
